        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"7c6b7d34-b5e1-4b58-8a3d-d065cf832ea9\",\"review_text\":\"Good 👍😊\"},{\"review_id\":\"c3ff3acc-bc1e-4bbb-ad9b-f1e26afaf2bb\",\"review_text\":\"I love this app very much . When I hear a song my mind is relax . So I love this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"f3fb629b-45b1-4967-98b5-1f2014ae6d58\",\"review_text\":\"Great app but the Ads are annoying 🙄\"},{\"review_id\":\"0f747f83-ca8a-40ca-a402-217c6a0af5b5\",\"review_text\":\"It's ok overall, great song selection , obviously for the premium version but, the free version isn't godd, still too much restriction to the point its almost unusable.\"},{\"review_id\":\"0cf2eda1-5309-4a5c-9127-d8f26e298283\",\"review_text\":\"I cant login and even get it to the apps, cant login with facebooks, apps tell me its error and offline, actually im not even offline, connection is good, can help?\"},{\"review_id\":\"084ad8d7-a9a3-4b9c-bbce-f1782cdbe843\",\"review_text\":\"Songs display incorrect in the notification bar. Prices too high\"},{\"review_id\":\"fc03caf5-7a3e-4fae-8bb1-fd442038f233\",\"review_text\":\"Good but lots of premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"9b1ffbf0-39e8-4f44-91b1-9c0daa2c1124\",\"review_text\":\"This app is good but one problem is adds are frequently appears so i want to tell that spotify developers please fix this issue overall app is good i like it so much\"},{\"review_id\":\"922dbe03-d325-4e1a-97dc-311ab05bbc69\",\"review_text\":\"Iam enjoyed this\"},{\"review_id\":\"d4da1bfa-97bc-4a85-a38c-cbf4478085a6\",\"review_text\":\"I have been using Spotify since 3-4 years but now it has degrated a lot . You can't play the song twice or jump into any lyrics . There is no lyrics available now. You can't even add a song to queue. Very disappointing. Everything is premium like how desperate can you be. I guess it's time to find a replacement.\"}]}"
